      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRING FABLE (8) struggled in tougher grade last start after drifting back at this track, but prior to that won comfortably by 5.5 lengths at this track (21.67) beating Cyclone Saskia in a Grade 6 on September 22. Comes through a solid form race last start. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. HARA'S AMBER (2) was strongly fancied last time but finished third (22.07), beaten 1.75 lengths. Racing well and deserves a win. I'M SUPER COOL (7) is a progressive dog who scored her 2nd career win last time at this track, scoring by half a length (26.01). Won at her only start from this box. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. CLASSIC BOODIE (1) showed plenty of dash to record a last start win. Big chance on that form.",
